{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/in-azura-residences","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"hits":[{"rank":null,"slug":"igo-azura-residences","about":"Azura Residences by IGO (Invest Group Overseas) is a stunning collection of 148 beautifully appointed residences that draws inspiration from its waterfront location. Blue water and sky frame the view. It is a tranquil sanctuary, yet just moments from the vibrant heart of Dubai. Not just the best of both worlds, it is home to infinite possibility.A stunning set of exclusive 1 to 3 Bedroom Apartments and 2 to 3 Bedroom Penthouses + private pools with a waterfront location, in the tranquil yet vibrant Dubai Islands. Azura’s stunning frontage and arrival lobby hint at the impeccable standards awaiting every resident. It is symbolic of the building’s scale and stature and reflective of its organic connection to the natural wonders of sky and sea. Clean lines and generous spaces define every Azura residence. The beautifully understated design allows the waterfront location to take centre stage. Serenity is everywhere, both inside and out. Inspired by the locality, the carefully considered colours and textures are timeless and have a distinctive sense of place. Every detail considered and curated. Sumptuous fabrics, cool stone and decadent detailing combine to complement and connect with the landscape beyond your balcony.","price":1500000,"title":"Azura Residences","bitrix":{"id":532,"pf_id":"are.3.13910","source":null,"project_id":"Dubai Islands","tower_name":null,"campaign_name":"Azura","property_type":"Apartment","developer_name":"IGO","project_location":"Deira"},"images":[{"340x252":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/340x252/feat_8042908310.webp","464x312":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/464x312/feat_8042908310.webp"}],"status":"pending","_geoloc":{"lat":25.2809393,"lng":55.2936686},"country":"dubai","images1":[{"340x252":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cl